# Both images build from the REPO ROOT as context (the npm-workspaces lockfile
# lives here), so this file is what keeps that context small and — more
# importantly — keeps secrets out of the layers.

# ---- SECURITY: never let an env file enter the build context ----------------
# apps/gutcallfun-core/.env holds the live TxODDS JWT + API token. A COPY of an
# app directory would otherwise bake them into an image that gets pushed to a
# public registry. Runtime config arrives via Swarm env/secrets instead.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*

# ---- Build/install output (regenerated inside the image) --------------------
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# ---- Repo material with no place in a runtime image -------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.github
.planning
.claude
docs
initial-request-src

# Design-tool scratch: a second, broken Next app nested inside the UI. Excluded
# from tsconfig too — it must never reach a build.
**/claude-design-output

# Local-only harness, deliberately uncommitted.
apps/gutcallfun-test-ui

# ---- Deploy descriptors (consumed by Swarm/CI, not by the image) ------------
stack.yml
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile

# ---- Noise ------------------------------------------------------------------
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/*.md
!apps/*/README.md
